@startuml SpringSecurity_Sequence_FormLogin
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title 序列图 — 表单登录认证

actor "User" as User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "FilterChainProxy" as FCP
participant "UsernamePassword\nAuthenticationFilter" as LoginFilter
participant "AuthenticationManager\n(ProviderManager)" as AuthnMgr
participant "DaoAuthenticationProvider" as DaoProvider
participant "UserDetailsService" as UDS
participant "PasswordEncoder" as Encoder
participant "SecurityContext\nRepository" as CtxRepo
participant "AuthenticationSuccess\nHandler" as Success

User -> Browser: 提交用户名/密码
Browser -> FCP: POST /login
FCP -> LoginFilter: 匹配登录请求
LoginFilter -> LoginFilter: 创建 UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n(未认证)
LoginFilter -> AuthnMgr: authenticate(token)
AuthnMgr -> DaoProvider: authenticate(token)
DaoProvider -> UDS: loadUserByUsername()
UDS --> DaoProvider: UserDetails
DaoProvider -> Encoder: matches(raw, encoded)
alt 凭证无效
    Encoder --> DaoProvider: false
    DaoProvider --> AuthnMgr: BadCredentialsException
    AuthnMgr --> LoginFilter: 认证失败
    LoginFilter --> Browser: 重定向至登录失败页
else 凭证有效
    Encoder --> DaoProvider: true
    DaoProvider --> AuthnMgr: 已认证 Authentication
    AuthnMgr --> LoginFilter: Authentication
    LoginFilter -> CtxRepo: 保存 SecurityContext
    LoginFilter -> Success: onAuthenticationSuccess()
    Success --> Browser: 重定向至原请求或默认成功 URL
end

@enduml
